<description>&lt;p&gt;Armed men ambushed a market convoy in western Niger, killing at least 37 civilians. In northern Burkina Faso, rival jihadist groups JNIM and ISSP intensified clashes, targeting each other. Bandits in Niger State killed two kidnapping victims despite a six-million-naira ransom payment. The conflict produced 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOSGs3X3NFbXZ6ckVtTkEwVzZIdGhRTjVzLVhYVHhuN0ZrWHRYTFJrLU5FbGVDRG9yUVJtRmZCUENRandfb0FEdENSU3IxMWtfVHQxZHZkcHdVWG50WExZVWxmbE91N044bGkwUnZDZ0FybnV1YnpwZS1jWnNxMDE2QnoyaFlZUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Post Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxNR0tsQzdQdS1zem1xMkJFeUZqR3FsV3draGV2aWdOTVVOMlZGOWdOb3M4Mk9RT3NPcjhlekJ1Zk10cWlqbjU0TGJXaUVwdHhDTmdBalZ5WEFNNktmRjdxajB1bnhWVm5UWmo4c2JCWGw4VzQxY1pxLUFZSF9Oamd2R2NnczlRd3BFWEJna2hmUHdxdmhjNkNMOA?oc=5&quot;&gt;theopenpress.in&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMid0FVX3lxTE5vempybEdteUFHYUhQYzB4VlVsV1VfZU9OczRXdjlFT0VqZlZvZTRiaTB0SjRBTVpFdGFXVWZsX21EQ05KcGsxczk2YVdpZFdlNTFyYmoydWJaSFZ0NXZwRDdaejdXbll1TjlDdF9MWUR1aGlXRlkw?oc=5&quot;&gt;DNE Africa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Foot-Africa.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQT3dKc2d0Wnh4NWlLZmp0QVBtTml1ZWROdER3S1ktNDdTaFhSM1FfYkVwR3BqSUZxZlJUNjZpazJmcEdPbWVUbE9iNWpSTXlZd1BkenlCWGtoQm56dlQxVTI5VWF2WEFFd2tHNlNEQ3ctYTlzal8yWnJRdjRZM0FCRkJ6cHRDYjg5ZkpkLVVFTV9ZU2NIMl9jaGtMamZKRWF0LThlZWVRU0RVVURhVlhVUE5lcG5zZWph?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/article